..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : OPENDOWNPAYMENTS.SE
.. Author         : cl
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : mh
.. Functionality  :
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
.type integer  xi  ? _F|defined(U|xi)
..
.assign P|maskkontextfop = "Verkauf"
.copy M|bverkauf = G|TRUE
.protection lief
.protection bestellung
.protection bprolief
..
.. set last day of previous month
.formula U|xi = ('G|datum:8'>>2)
.formula M|stichtag = G|datum - U|xi
.copy M|bmonatsende = G|TRUE
.copy M|treffer = G|TRUE
..
.copy M|storno = G|FALSE
.formula M|inlwaehr = G|inland
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
